OL,3,GNEWSADirty Sanchez star honours Michael
OL,4,A'Pancho' Locke on Everest trek
OL,5,
OL,6,FA tribute flag to Michael "Pancho"
OL,7,FLocke has reached Everest Base Camp
OL,8,Fafter his former Dirty Sanchez co-star
OL,9,FMathew Pritchard dedicated his
OL,10,FHimalayan trek to the Welsh TV star and
OL,11,Fentrepreneur.
OL,13,FLocke's former co-conspirator on MTV
OL,14,Fstunt and prank series had already
OL,15,Fstarted the challenge when he learned
OL,16,Fthe news of Locke's death last Friday,
OL,17,F6 November, aged 47.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
