OL,3,GNEWSADirty Sanchez star honours Michael
OL,4,A'Pancho' Locke on Everest trek
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Cardiff presenter and skateboarder
OL,7,Fsaid he was now heading home to "give
OL,8,FPanch a send-off", after spending the
OL,9,Fjourney reflecting on more than 35
OL,10,Fyears of friendship.
OL,12,F"He had the biggest heart and was one
OL,13,Fof the kindest souls you could ever
OL,14,Fmeet," he said, adding there was
OL,15,F"never, ever a dull moment" with Locke.
